ll,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-19T09:28:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T03:58:40Z","closed_at":"2026-08-27T17:33:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.7 stable (Mono), not tested in other versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700 (20 threads) - 63.79 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n_Observed behaviour_: Editing a PackedVector2Array through Remote does not change the value in the running game, whereas editing in the scene works fine.\n\n_Expected behaviour_: Editing a PackedVector2Array through Remote will update the live object in the running game, just as when editing a scene.\n\nIn the supplied MVP this behaviour can be seen with the built-in Line2D type, but I first saw it with a custom C# class so I don't believe it is related to Line2D in particular.\n\nIn the debugger, the following error appears:\n\n+ E 0:00:11:224   fieldwise_assign: Method/function failed. Returning: p_target\n+  <C++ Source>  core/math/math_fieldwise.cpp:239 @ fieldwise_assign()\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project with a 2d root.\n2. Add a Line2D node.\n3. Add several points to the line that will be visible in the default camera.\n\n(Steps 1 - 3 are in the MVP project already, so you can just download that instead)\n\n4. Run the project.\n5. Edit the points on the Line2D in the Local scene view, observe that the line changes in the running game.\n6. Switch to Remote, and edit the points on the Line2D. Observe that any changes immediately revert and the line in the running game is unaffected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[vector-array-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31216679/vector-array-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.